Z||000021||JSocha||09-20-2001||09:29 PM||||Wondering what happened to mwa?<P>Made it home!<P>Left Dallas at 7:30 AM on Tuesday (late start) and pulled into Rugby at 6:00 AM on Wendesday.  My DSL connection at home is down and I skipped out of work today due to a fever and the cr*ps (Sqouch, how were you feeling after eating at Braums? I felt lousy!)<P>Anyhow, car worked fine all the way home!  Now its at the mechanics here in Rugby getting a going over and all the fluids replaced since I put 2K on it just driving.<P>Everyone! I was happy to meet you and thank you so much for your hospitality!  You guys are fantastic.<P>Sorry Loki that we didn't meet up.  Attempted to call you, but your phone was disconnected.  And of course JohnF and IwannaIRM let you know what was up so if you could meet up with me, we could.<P>Maryjane, I made several attempts to call you for a possible get together.  You must not believe in an answering machine  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>Anyways, I'm home safe and sound!<P>I'll write more later when I get my DSL connection at home working.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 09-20-2001).]||||reg||6
