Z||000023||sqoach||09-21-2001||11:59 AM||||I feel just fine!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>However, I did eat biscuits and gravy and that same Braum's before and got sick. I forgot about that. We shoulda went to Mc D's. I bet that's the last time you'll eat there!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>Glad you made it home ok.||||reg||1
Z||000024||JSocha||09-21-2001||05:30 PM||||YEP! That will be the last time I eat there and last time I let you take me out to a greasy spoon during a visit like that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>To many pit stops in between after I finally made it half way through Nebraska.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Just glad my rear end held out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> or is it in  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> !  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> nyuk! nyuk! nyuk!||||reg||9
